          %h3#causal_locality_of_interacting_field_quantum_observables Causal locality of interacting field quantum observables
          #CausalLocalityOfBogoliubovFormula.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+locality"}> causal locality
                )
            %p
              As the spacetime support varies, the algebras of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interacting+field+quantum+observables"} interacting field quantum observables
              spanned via the Bogoliubov formula consistitute a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causally+local+net+of+observables"} causally local net of observables
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbative+AQFT"} perturbative AQFT
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#DuetschFredenhagen00"}> Dütsch-Fredenhagen 00, section 3
            , following
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#BrunettiFredenhagen99"} Brunetti-Fredenhagen 99, section 8
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#IlinSlavnov78"} Il’in-Slavnov 78
          %p
            For
            %strong
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof"} proof
            see
            %a{:href => "S-matrix#PerturbativeQuantumObservablesIsLocalnet"} this prop.
            at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S-matrix"} S-matrix
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+M%C3%B8ller+operator"} quantum Møller operator
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interacting+field+algebra"} interacting field algebra
          %div
            %table
              %thead
                %tr
                  %th
                    product in
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbative+QFT"} perturbative QFT
                  %th
                    %math#mathml_27ee5fe71b396df84a9f4b19030bbbae0b7c742f_1.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
